sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Streamlit dashboard
  participant DB as dashboard_data.csv
  participant EV as Evidence tables
  User->>UI: choose issue date
  UI->>DB: load rows for that date
  DB-->>UI: forecasts, ranges, probabilities, alert flags, why text
  UI->>UI: map AQI to category colour and burden tier
  UI-->>User: map, table with ranges, advisories
  User->>UI: tick reveal what actually happened
  UI-->>User: actual daily AQI for +1, +2, +3 days
  User->>UI: open evidence tab
  UI->>EV: read skill, calibration, coverage tables
  EV-->>UI: results and figures
  UI-->>User: evidence and limitations
